{"game": "helldivers-2", "language": "schinese", "appid": 553850, "month": "2025-10", "window": 4, "start_date": 1761264000, "end_date": 1761955199, "month_true_total": 809, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 22:29:15 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "208084316", "author": {"steamid": "76561199194737663", "personaname": "KeYoShY", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199194737663/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 11502, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 10886, "last_played": 1774017677, "avatar": "3f5e9daea59216d7fe13df4e031d3537580e5e21"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "首先我是一名全成就玩家，这可以体现我对这游戏的热爱，但是绝地潜兵2越更新越烂，买游戏到现在从支持变成现在的厌恶，优化是越做越差的，bug是不会修的，武器是从能玩到变成滋水枪的，敌人是不断加强的，潜兵是不断削弱的，开发人员是连N5都是打不过的，箭头和索尼是没有母亲的。First I am a player with all achievements，This can demonstrate my previous enthusiasm for this game，but HELLDIVERS2 has become worse with each update. From the moment I bought the game, my feelings have changed from support to disgusting. The optimization has been getting worse and worse, bugs cannot be fixed, weapons have gone from playable to water guns, enemies have been constantly strengthened, while the helldiver agents have been constantly weakened. The developers can't even complete N5, the Arrowhead and SONY have no mothers.", "timestamp_created": 1761949224, "timestamp_updated": 1761950703, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "208069004", "author": {"steamid": "76561199653371633", "personaname": "自在笑药", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199653371633/", "num_games_owned": 60, "num_reviews": 2, "playt